23. DR. TARIQ FAZAL CHAUDHARY, Minister for Parliamentary Affairs, to move that the Bill toamend the Special Technology Zones Authority Acl, 2O2t [The Special Technology Zones Authority(Amendment) 8n1,2025), be passed.
PAPERS
TO BE LAID BEFORE
THE NATIONAL ASSEMBLY:
24. MR, AZAM NAZEER TARAR, Minister for Human Rights, to lay before National Assembly theannual reports of the National Commission for Human Rights for the years 2023 and 2024, undersub-section (2) of section 28 of the National Commission for Human Rights Act, 2012.
25. MR. MUHAMMAD AURANGZEB, Minister for Finance and Revenue, to lay before NationalAssembly the Mid-year Budget Review Report for the year, 2024-25 under sub-section (1) of section34 of the Public Finance Management Act, 2019.
26. MR. MUHAMMAD AURANGZEB, Minister for Finance and Revenue, to lay before NationalAssembly the Half year Report of the Board of Directors of State Bank of Pakistan on the State ofPakistan's Economy for the year 2024-25, under sub-section (2) of section 39 of the State Bank ofPakista n Act, 1956.
PRESENTATION OF PERIOOICAL RE
RTS OF THE STANDING COMMITTEE
27. NAWABZADA IFTIKHAR AHMED KHAN BABAR, Chairman Standing Committee on Aviation, topresent the Periodical Report of the Committee for the period 7't July,2024 to 31st December, 2024,as required by rule 234-4 ofthe Rules of Procedure and Conduct of Business in the National Assembly,2007.
2a. MS. MUNAZA HASSAN, Chairperson Standing Committee on Climate Change andEnvironmental Coordination, to present the Periodical Report of the Committee for the period 1't July,2024 to 31st December, 2024, as required by rule 234-A of the Rules of Procedure and Conduct ofBusiness in the National Assembly, 2007.
29. RAI HASSAN NAWAZ KHAN, Chairman Standing Committee on Railways, to present thePeriodical Report of the Committee for the period 7't July,2024 to 31st December,2024, as requiredby rule 234-A of the Rules of Procedure and Conduct of Business in the National Assembly, 2007.
30. DR. MAHESH KUMAR MAtANl, Chairman Standing Committee on National Health Services,Regulations and Coordination, to present the Periodical Report of the Committee for the period 1stJuly,2O24to 31st December, 2024, as required by rule 234-A of the Rules of Procedure and Conduct ofBusiness in the National Assembly, 2007.
31. SYED HAFEEZUDDIN, Chairman Standing Committee on lndustries and Production, to presentthe Periodical Report of the Committee for the period L't )uly, 2024 to 31't Decembet, 2024, asrequired by rule 234-4 of the Rules of Procedure and Conduct of Business in the National Assembly,2007.
32. MR. AZIM UDDIN ZAHID, Chairman Standing Committee on Federal Education, ProfessionalTraining, National Heritage and Culture, to present the Periodical Report of the Committee for theperiod 1't July, 2024 to 31't December, 2024, as required by rule 234-4 of the Rules of Procedure andConduct of Business in the NationalAssembly, 2007.

