33. MR. MUHAMMAD IDREES, Chairman Standing Committee on Energy (Power Division), topresent the Periodical Report of the Committee for the period 1'r July,2024 to 31st December, 2024,as required by rule 234-A of the Rules of Procedure and Conduct of Business in the National Assembly,2007.
34. MR. JAVAID IQBAI- Chairman Standing Committee on Defence Production, to present thePeriodical Report of the Committee for the period Lst July, 2024 to 31't December, 2024, as requiredby rule 234-A ofthe Rules of Procedure and Conduct of Business in the National Assembly, 2007.
35. RAJA KHURRAM SHAHZAD NAWAZ, Chairman Standing Committee on lnterior, to presentthe Periodical Report of the Committee for the period 7st )uly,2024 to 31'r December, 2024, asrequired by rule 234-4 ofthe Rules of Procedure and Conduct of Business in the National Assembly,2001.MOTION OF THANKS36. Further discussion on the following motion moved by DR. TARIQ FAZAL CHAUDHARY,Minister for Parliamentary Affairs on 12th March, 2025:-"This House expresses its deep gratitude to the President of the lslamic Republic of Pakistanfor his address to both Houses assembled together on 10th March, 2025."MATTERS OTHER THAN POINTS OF ORDER
37.
Raising matters under Rule 18 which are not Points of Order.CATLING ATTENTION NOTICE
38. MR. MUHAMMAD MIQDAD ALI KHAN to invite attention of the Minister for WaterResources, to a matter of urgent public importance regarding non-construction of embankments onthe river Jhelum at Tehsil Sahiwal, District Sargodha, causing grave concern amongst the public.
lslamabad, the4th Mav,2025
TAHIR HUSSAINSecretary General

